            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sarah Jo"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is one drink that I have a couple times during the holiday season. It's a little on the sweet side, but great for those who like chocolate and mint together. TIP: This is even better if you use a scoop of vanilla bean ice cream instead of the cream and mix it up in the blender until smooth."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jay Joseph"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Great flavor. Instead of 1/2 &amp; 1/2, I used soft ice cream instead and it was amazing",
            "datePublished": "2024-03-05T00:27:56.920Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
